  "_cross_faction_potions": "Not checked by the script; for the shop authors. Instant or short restores in use: kingdom 240 HP / 140 mana; clans 230 / 130; neutral Weighstall 260 / 160; sylvan 270 HP over 6 s / 165 mana; deathless 220 / 125. WC3 race-shop potions: 250 / 150.",
